; Leg EC -- CONTROL on the SPARSE root.  Same as EA, one VOLUME over.
;
; BENCH take-file: there is no "set line" here.  ~/.kermrc names the adapter.
; CHECK THAT IT NAMES THE ONE THAT IS PLUGGED IN.
;
;  Victor receives into D:\, which has 26 root entries against A:'s 184.
;  CONTROL VALUE, SS16bc leg HN: 52.602 s host, elapsed 5500 cs,
;  dec max=100 at #3, 39,564 wire bytes, 1 timeout / 1 resend, 622 cps.
;
;  RUN ED IMMEDIATELY AFTER THIS.
;
; READ IT WITH:
;     python3 v9k/tools/pktstat.py --rxbytes <from STEPEC.OUT (written to A: on purpose)> s16bdEC.pkt
; Residual -11 clean, +28 with a startup timeout.
; cmp FIRST, then the counters.  A leg that is fast and wrong is the failure.

set speed 9600
set receive timeout 20
set parity none
set prefixing cautious
set block 3
set retry 30
log packets s16bdEC.pkt
send rcvec.dat
statistics
